230
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
-Ei, ja ma ei kavatse ka.

231
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
Ma ei maini seda jopet, mitte mingil juhul.

232
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
