00:39:19,880 --> 00:39:23,560
Ma ei tahtnud solvata.

1485
00:39:23,600 --> 00:39:24,640
CLARKSON: Sa ei ole sõnaõigust rikkunud.

1486
00:39:25,560 --> 00:39:27,040
Ma pean selle ära tegema, kuradi olgu!

1487
00:39:27,080 --> 00:39:30,440
Ei, sa justkui vandusid.

1488
00:39:27,080 --> 00:39:30,440
See oli siis juba solvav.

1489
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:32,200
(rehvid hõikavad)

1490
00:39:32,240 --> 00:39:37,400
Okei, see on.

1491
00:39:32,240 --> 00:39:37,400
peaaegu täiuslik.

1492
00:39:32,240 --> 00:39:37,400
nagu see käib, ütleme siis.

1493
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:40,600
Täpselt nii, see on ideaalne.

1494
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:40,600
ei ole reaalset esirattade libisemist.

1495
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:40,600
See on tore näha.

1496
00:39:40,640 --> 00:39:44,480
70... 80...

1497
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:49,560
Jah.

1498
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:49,560
See on hea näha.
70... 80...
CLARKSON: Jah.

1499
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:51,880
Jah, ma tundsin end hästi.

1500
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:51,880
lähen seal läbi.

1501
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:55,040
Ma sain selle neljandasse käikudesse.

1502
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:55,040
just nimelt kui ma rehvidele jõudsin.

1503
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,360
See on kurv.

1504
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:59,000
See on...

1505
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:59,000
Oh, vaata, kuidas see käitub.

1506
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:59,000
Ta on seal veidi rahutu.

1507
00:39:59,040 --> 00:40:00,840
See on väga hea käekiri.

1508
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,280
See on hea šassi, see on.

1509
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,280
aga sa ju hakkad...

1510
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,280
...sa saad sellest maksimumi.

1511
00:40:03,320 --> 00:40:07,240
ja see on ka väga hea.

1512
00:40:03,320 --> 00:40:07,240
